{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十一首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十六首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一百二首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十一首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十九首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遂禮拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "封龕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "掛真"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "掃塔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上供"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "茶毗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真身一仰一俯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在寺之東北，其形如鶴，故名。郡志云：東晉時，望氣者言山有異氣，命\n工鑿之，朝鑿暮合。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在寺之左畔。漢梅福於此跨鸞昇天。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即寺之後屏，其山團團，上圓而下濶，形如撒網"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在寺之西南，兩峯對峙，形如二童。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即寺之正朝也。其峯五瓣，形如梅花。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在寺之東南。奇秀峭󳫠，形如屏帳，為近城諸山之最。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其山在寺對岸阿中，其形如虎。前有方山截住，勢欲跳出而不能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指鉄獅峯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在猛虎之陽，即前方山是也，其形似之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在寺前隔岸，兩山圓伏，牙鼻俱全，謂之大小二象。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在永安寺右，即白雲下砂也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "溪自松政而來，其形如帶，橫遶寺前。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其洲長亘寺前，縱橫二里許。鋪氈，乃堪輿家言也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二山在隔岸溪邊，一上一下，其形似魚，故名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其山在寺前隔岸，圓頂飛帶，形如寶葢，故名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "等純興燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "燒香，云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遂燒香"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "燒香云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遂展拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遂燒香"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "示恒濤禪人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "提綱云：森羅及萬象，一法之所印。且道把印底是誰？咄！切忌泥裏洗土塊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著語云：君不見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不從他得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "春生、夏長、秋收、冬藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此語亦不受"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "用知作麼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採得是好手"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無無亦不是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兩重也有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "提綱云：我本來茲土，傳法救迷情，且道法作麼生傳？莫謗祖師好。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著語云：是甚麼？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人傍得他。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "路上人焉知家裏事？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "直饒到家，\n亦未許渠在。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "逃峯赴壑。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "霜眉\n雪𩬆火中出，堂堂終不落今時。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "合取口。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "早落西東了也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "提綱云：離生正位，云何有機？理量二智，就位轉位，立玄機之名。不涉功勳一句\n作麼生？看取下面註脚。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著語云：渠不是無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "渠豈是有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二邊莫立，中道不居"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通身是，徧\n身是，大悲千眼覰莫及"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從來不合伴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天真而玅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "懸崖撒手，自肯承當"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "絕後再甦，欺君不得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "提綱云：是法住法位，前是佛殿，後是法堂，法位在什麼處？不得動著。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著語云：長者長法身，短者短法身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一串穿却"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "衣珠原燦爛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "何處不先輝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲開月露"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一不\n可得，三自何來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誰不丈夫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "向自\n己胸中流出，葢天葢地去"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "提綱云：見月休觀指。指在這裏，月在什麼處？月在這裏，指在什麼處？試辨看。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著語云：空谷傳聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同一舌頭。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說有執有，說空執空。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "直饒道箇\n非空非有，亦有扳緣之者。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因病處方。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "機感應生，機亡應息，總不干他事。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真性緣起。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十世古今，始終不離於當念。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "提綱云：不墮五音，非關六律，還有和得者麼？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著語云：孤村陋店，莫挂瓶盂。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此去上京不遠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "打作兩橛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "直饒\n到清虛一色之地，正墮覺經四相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "迷來無始"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悟在如今"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正是放身命處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是真供養"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "提綱云：除病不除法，藥病一時拈却了也，還我到家消息來。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著語云：差在甚麼處？看取下句註脚。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無住為真住，非家却是家。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無人能到。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛眼莫覰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無賓主句拈出了也，還有領話者麼？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從來不曾離合箇什麼？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金鷄啼破夢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "將謂有多少奇特。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "提綱云：無為無事人，猶是金鎖難。轉身一句作麼生？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著語云：毒海深廣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻身那畔，\n出入躊躇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有願入塵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "怖塵就位"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從正垂偏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疾歸正位"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夜半正明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是虛是實，子細定當始得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "提綱云：不居正位、不住偏方底人，且道作麼生行履？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著語云：異類中行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不逐四時\n凋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清涼熱惱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "警覺羣迷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈風廣扇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧日高臨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "關空鎖夢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大用現前，不存規則"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "提綱云：位前如是，正位如何？還有造到其中者麼？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著語云：可以東，可以西。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "多沉\n\n毒海。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "類弗齊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "混不得。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡能所。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "絕影象。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正好掩口。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "住住，恩大難酬。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五位乃法門之大全，有鼻孔者，苟不知此，不落於今時，濁智流轉，即\n滯於劫外，墮於毒海，故誡參尋之士，切要知之，不可忽也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一微涉動\n境，成此頹山勢，以動落今時，違本分事也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不住不動，透出那邊，如金\n剛出匣，非智者莫能用也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "那叱太子，析骨肉，還父母，現本身，為說法，\n是善用金剛王寶劒，大機大用，得第一機者也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智眼空三界。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說法攝羣機。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正位中本無一法，而\n玅挾一切法，一切法與正位，非一非異，非實非虛，是回互也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "苟非\n親悟親證，而以比智知，是擬議而不離正位，是犯鋒鋩，失却威光也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即支\n法領所請之本三十四品八會"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "霈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "題䟦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "景陽鐘扣之以莛，則其聲不能出閫。客問：是所謂扣之以大者也。然非老人徹法源底，辨才無礙，烏能縱橫闔\n闢，予奪自如，發千聖未發之秘哉？真人難遇，正法難聞，敢與有識之君子共之。　法孫興林拜跋。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附來書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謝石公居士請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為黃鰲載居士作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "富沙開元請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "右壽悟明寺主。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉智藥三藏，自西域持菩提樹來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在󳱮東廣\n州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六祖在此\n樹下，披剃受戒，開甘露門，度人無量。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "春分屆令，此鳥即鳴，作好哥哥聲。催人東作之意甚切，作好哥哥。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清明屆令，此鳥即鳴，作歸去好聲。喚人歸去之意甚切，作歸去好。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無讐莫結讐"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "回\n頭好自修"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "放生得長壽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "免貽身後憂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂勉齋公"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晏坐"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "看經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念佛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道霈"}
